## JVM — Andar Kya Hota Hai?

**JVM = Java Virtual Machine**

Ye sirf ek "runner" nahi hai — andar kai kaam hote hain:

```
JVM ke andar:
├── Class Loader      ← .class file load karta hai
├── Bytecode Verifier ← check karta hai code safe hai ya nahi
├── Interpreter       ← ByteCode → Machine Code line by line
├── JIT Compiler      ← frequently use code ko fast banata hai
└── Garbage Collector ← unused memory automatically free karta hai
```

**Sabse important baat:**
> JVM platform dependent hota hai — har OS ka alag JVM hota hai।
> But `.class` file (ByteCode) platform independent hoti hai।

Isliye — **ek baar compile karo, kahin bhi chalao!** ✅

