## JSE, JEE, JME — Java Ke Teen Flavours

Java ek hi nahi hai — **teen versions** hain alag alag use cases ke liye!

### ☕ JSE — Java Standard Edition
- **Sabse basic aur common Java**
- Desktop applications, command line programs
- Yehi hum abhi seekh rahe hain!
- Core libraries — Collections, IO, Networking etc.

### 🏢 JEE — Java Enterprise Edition
- **Bade scale ke web applications** ke liye
- Banks, e-commerce sites, enterprise software
- JSE ke upar build hota hai — extra features add hote hain
- Servlets, JSP, EJB jaise technologies

### 📱 JME — Java Micro Edition
- **Chhote devices** ke liye — old mobile phones, embedded systems
- Limited memory aur processing wale devices
- Purane Nokia phones mein Java games — yehi tha!

```
JSE ──→ Desktop / Basic apps
JEE ──→ Web / Enterprise apps (JSE + extra)
JME ──→ Mobile / Embedded devices (lightweight)
```

